pressure-source-morte = They have the look of someone who just watched something die.
pressure-source-escuro = They keep glancing at the dark corners more than they should.
pressure-source-dor = They are hunched over in a way that is not only the wound.
pressure-source-solidao = They look like they have not spoken to anyone in a long while.

entity-effect-guidebook-add-mental-pressure =
    { $chance ->
        [1] Weighs
        *[other] weigh
    } on the mind of whoever consumes it

# The warning the person gets themselves, so the pressure does not build up in
# silence.
pressure-loneliness-warning = You feel terribly lonely...
